{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-007",
    "title": "雨廊来客"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_034",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "他没有问陆照临看见了什么，只问：“你愿不愿意承认自己看见过？”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "他们回到听雨院时，天还没有亮。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 801,
          "end": 801
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有进屋，只站在廊下替陆照临包扎手臂。她带的药粉很细，撒在伤口上立刻凝成一层薄膜，疼痛却没有减轻。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 803,
          "end": 803
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你在井下听见了什么？”她问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 805,
          "end": 805
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人说，第三盏灯送回去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 807,
          "end": 807
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“是男人还是女人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 809,
          "end": 809
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“听不清。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 811,
          "end": 811
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“像从哪里传来？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 813,
          "end": 813
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“裂缝。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 815,
          "end": 815
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把布条打成结：“你父亲以前也去过那口井？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 817,
          "end": 817
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向袖中的半截灯杆。杆身内侧的刻字已经被他擦干净，唯独“陆沉舟”三个字清晰得刺眼。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 819,
          "end": 819
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我不知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 821,
          "end": 821
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你知道他是引灯人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 823,
          "end": 823
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这是我昨晚才知道的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 825,
          "end": 825
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可你看见那三个字时，没有惊讶。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 827,
          "end": 827
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临沉默片刻：“我只是早就怀疑。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 829,
          "end": 829
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离没有追问。她收起剩下的药粉，转身走到院门口，又停住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 831,
          "end": 831
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那枚石片还在井里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 833,
          "end": 833
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 835,
          "end": 835
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人会来拿。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 837,
          "end": 837
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“沈砚秋？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 839,
          "end": 839
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可能是她，也可能是把她调开的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 841,
          "end": 841
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她离开后，陆照临独自回到屋内。窗外的天色从灰转白，听雨院的弟子陆续起床。有人谈论昨夜西坡的灯，有人说戒律堂封了山道，也有人说外门试炼的名单被重新抄了一遍。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 843,
          "end": 843
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临把半截灯杆放在桌上。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 845,
          "end": 845
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灯杆内侧的刻字旁，还有一道极浅的凹槽。凹槽形状与废井石片上的残印相同。它原本像是用来嵌入某种薄片，后来薄片被取走，只留下边缘磨损的痕迹。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 847,
          "end": 847
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他想起石片周围那片拒绝落灰的空间。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 849,
          "end": 849
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "那不是普通的灵石，也不是法器。更像某种被刻意留在时间之外的东西。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 851,
          "end": 851
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "午后，沈砚秋派人送来一张传唤条。陆照临到登记堂时，她正站在三盏长明灯下，手里捧着一只黑漆木盒。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 853,
          "end": 853
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“昨夜你越过封闭线。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 855,
          "end": 855
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我拿到了灯芯和铜环。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 857,
          "end": 857
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“东西呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 859,
          "end": 859
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临没有回答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 861,
          "end": 861
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋把木盒放在桌上：“交出来，便只记一次越界。隐瞒，便交戒律堂处理。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 863,
          "end": 863
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果我交出的是断灯杆呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 865,
          "end": 865
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋没有打开：“与你无关。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 891,
          "end": 891
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“如果和我父亲有关呢？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 893,
          "end": 893
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“更与你无关。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 895,
          "end": 895
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把传唤条推回他面前：“今晚之前，把所有从西坡带走的东西交给我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 897,
          "end": 897
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临拿起传唤条，转身走到门口。门外台阶下，顾长离靠着石柱等他。她没有问传唤内容，只递来一张折叠的纸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 899,
          "end": 899
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我查到了废井的旧图。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 901,
          "end": 901
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临展开。图上标出七盏废灯的位置，最下方的裂缝被红墨圈了三次。右侧另有一行小字：残印未全，缺一角。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 903,
          "end": 903
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“这张图从哪里来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 905,
          "end": 905
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“顾氏账房。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 907,
          "end": 907
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你家族知道那口井？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 909,
          "end": 909
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“知道得比我多，但他们不肯告诉我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 911,
          "end": 911
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你为什么给我看？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 913,
          "end": 913
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向他掌心：“因为你已经被它选中了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 915,
          "end": 915
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临低头。那道淡青色痕迹不知何时重新显现，比昨夜更清晰。纹路并不完整，缺口正朝向他腕骨。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 917,
          "end": 917
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“选中是什么意思？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 919,
          "end": 919
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 921,
          "end": 921
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把纸收回一半，又停住：“今晚子时，我们再去一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 923,
          "end": 923
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“沈砚秋会派人看守。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 925,
          "end": 925
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以不能从山道进。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 927,
          "end": 927
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离示意陆照临退后。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-068",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 935,
          "end": 935
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“可我看见过。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1077,
          "end": 1077
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她把薄纸重新收进盒里：“看见不等于知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1079,
          "end": 1079
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "雨廊尽头忽然传来脚步声。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1081,
          "end": 1081
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "来人穿着洗得发白的青衫，衣摆沾着泥，腰间挂着一枚铜环。铜环只剩半圈，却与陆照临在杂木林里捡到的那枚断片纹路相同。他走得很慢，像对玄霄宗的院落十分熟悉，又刻意不让任何弟子看清自己的脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1083,
          "end": 1083
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋合上木盒：“这里不是外客该来的地方。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1085,
          "end": 1085
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青衫人停在雨廊另一端：“我是来还一盏灯的。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1087,
          "end": 1087
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他从袖中取出一只小灯盏。灯盏没有灯芯，罩内却浮着一层青白雾气。雾气贴着玻璃转了一圈，最后凝成半个圆纹。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1089,
          "end": 1089
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋的脸色冷了下来：“叶观澜。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1091,
          "end": 1091
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "青衫人笑了笑：“沈执事还记得我。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1093,
          "end": 1093
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“归墟盟的人不能进玄霄宗。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1095,
          "end": 1095
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我已经进来了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1097,
          "end": 1097
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜说话时，目光越过沈砚秋，落到陆照临身上。他没有问陆照临看见了什么，只问：“你愿不愿意承认自己看见过？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 1099,
          "end": 1099
        }
      }
    ],
